# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on every platform (Windows-safe).
# Without this, git `core.autocrlf` checks files out as CRLF on Windows, and the
# biome formatter (LF-only) flags every file, so `bun run check` reports hundreds
# of spurious line-ending errors. Added 2026-07-03 alongside Windows dev support.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known-binary assets git must never line-ending-convert (content auto-detection
# also covers the extension-less bundled sidecars under resources/).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary
*.wasm binary
*.nii  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.dcm  binary
*.exe  binary
